  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The shader used to debug PhysBones and Contacts is over-rendering the outer tunnel vision vignette.\nThis issue could potentially be attributed to the early queue of the material, the default queue for the outer vignette is 1, whereas the default queue of the inner vignette is 5000.\nHow to reproduce the issue:\n1. Enable either the high or low intensity tunnel vision, preferably the higher one.\n2. Turn on one of the 'Avatar Overlay' debug displays so that the overlay shader is visible.\n3. Walk or move around so that the tunnel vision vignette is present.\n4. Notice how the overlays are clearly visible in front of the outer tunnel vision vignette shader.",
